// Part 2 DAG, exposure = IPI (interpregnancy interval), births with an earlier pregnancy only.
// Same nodes as the shared model, plus: IPI, PriorLoss = earlier fetal death/termination (PRIORTERM),
// PriorDead = earlier child now dead (PRIORDEAD), PrevPTB = previous preterm birth (RF_PPB),
// Uprior = unmeasured causes shared by earlier and current pregnancy outcomes.
// IPI -> BMI: weight kept after the earlier pregnancy, so BMI is a mediator here (not adjusted).
dag {
IPI [exposure]
Death [outcome]
U [latent]
Uprior [latent]
Age -> { Edu Parity Smoke0 BMI HTN DM Death }
Race -> { Edu Pay Smoke0 BMI HTN DM Death }
Nativity -> { Edu Smoke0 BMI HTN Death }
Edu -> { Pay Smoke0 BMI Death }
Pay -> { Smoke0 HTN DM Death }
Parity -> { Smoke0 BMI HTN Death }
Smoke0 -> { BMI HTN DM GA BW Death }
BMI -> { HTN DM GA Death }
Year -> { BMI HTN DM Death }
HTN -> { GA BW Death }
DM -> { GA BW Death }
U -> { GA Death }
GA -> { BW Death }
BW -> Death
Age -> IPI
Race -> IPI
Nativity -> IPI
Edu -> IPI
Pay -> IPI
Parity -> IPI
Smoke0 -> IPI
Year -> IPI
PriorLoss -> IPI
PriorDead -> IPI
PrevPTB -> IPI
Uprior -> { PriorLoss PriorDead PrevPTB GA Death }
Age -> { PriorLoss PrevPTB }
Race -> { PriorDead PrevPTB }
IPI -> { BMI HTN GA BW Death }
}
